{"id":"A1-L106","title":"Want and need + to: introduction","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U07","focus":"Want / need + to — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Want / need + to — introdução","pron":"I am × I’m","verbs":[],"pv":["pick up"],"expr":[],"words":["ranch","barn","windmill","dam","reservoir","swamp","jungle","savanna","tundra","coral reef","bay","cape","peninsula","continent"],"field":"Lugares","genre":"Anúncio, folheto, aviso","skill":"Escuta","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 106 · Want and need + to: introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Want / need + to — introdução.","**Phrasal verbs:** pick up.","**Pronúncia:** I am × I’m.","**8 palavras novas** (lugares).","**Texto do dia:** anúncio, folheto, aviso."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo dizer o que quero e preciso fazer com want to e need to, e usar pick up."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["ranch","ranch"],["barn","barn"],["windmill","windmill"],["dam","dam"],["reservoir","reservoir"],["swamp","swamp"],["jungle","jungle"],["savanna","savanna"],["tundra","tundra"],["coral reef","coral reef"],["bay","bay"],["cape","cape"],["peninsula","peninsula"],["continent","continent"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An advertisement","blocks":[{"type":"ad","title":"Need a Ride?","lines":["Do you **need to** go to the airport? Do you **want to** save money? We **pick up** passengers at your door.","You **don’t need to** book early. Call us, and we **pick you up** in ten minutes. **Want to** know more? Visit our site!"],"gloss":[["airport","aeroporto"],["passenger","passageiro"],["book","reservar"],["save","economizar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The service goes to the airport.","ans":"T","why":"airport."},{"q":"You must book a week early.","ans":"F","why":"don’t need to."},{"q":"They pick you up in ten minutes.","ans":"T","why":"ten minutes."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“passenger” means…","opts":["passageiro","piloto","motorista"],"ans":0,"why":"passenger."},{"q":"“book” (verbo) means…","opts":["reservar","ler","comprar"],"ans":0,"why":"book."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Want / need + to","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Forma","Exemplo"],"rows":[["want to","**I want to travel.**"],["need to","**I need to study.**"],["negativa","**I don’t want to wait.**"],["pergunta","**Do you want to go?**"]],"cap":"Want / need + to"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Depois de **want/need** vem **to + verbo base**."},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Não use -ing: *I want go* ✗, *I want going* ✗."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I want ___ travel. (to)","a":"to","why":"to + verbo."},{"s":"She needs ___ study. (to)","a":"to","why":"to + verbo."},{"s":"We ___ pick you up. (pick up)","a":"pick up","why":"pick up."},{"s":"Do you ___ to go? (want)","a":"want","why":"want to."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["airport","aeroporto"],["passenger","passageiro"],["book","reservar"],["save","economizar"],["door","porta"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["want","to","go","When","do","you"],"ans":"When do you want to go","pt":"Quando quer ir?"},{"words":["the","airport","I","need","to","go","to"],"ans":"I need to go to the airport","pt":"Preciso ir ao aeroporto."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"ranch","pos":"word","pt":"ranch","ex":"rancho","expt":"A horse ranch."},{"w":"barn","pos":"word","pt":"barn","ex":"celeiro","expt":"A red barn."},{"w":"windmill","pos":"word","pt":"windmill","ex":"moinho de vento","expt":"An old windmill."},{"w":"dam","pos":"word","pt":"dam","ex":"represa","expt":"A huge dam."},{"w":"reservoir","pos":"word","pt":"reservoir","ex":"reservatório","expt":"A full reservoir."},{"w":"swamp","pos":"word","pt":"swamp","ex":"pântano","expt":"A wet swamp."},{"w":"jungle","pos":"word","pt":"jungle","ex":"selva","expt":"A thick jungle."},{"w":"savanna","pos":"word","pt":"savanna","ex":"savana","expt":"A dry savanna."},{"w":"tundra","pos":"word","pt":"tundra","ex":"tundra","expt":"A cold tundra."},{"w":"coral reef","pos":"word","pt":"coral reef","ex":"recife de coral","expt":"A coral reef."},{"w":"bay","pos":"word","pt":"bay","ex":"baía","expt":"A calm bay."},{"w":"cape","pos":"word","pt":"cape","ex":"cabo","expt":"A rocky cape."},{"w":"peninsula","pos":"word","pt":"peninsula","ex":"península","expt":"A long peninsula."},{"w":"continent","pos":"word","pt":"continent","ex":"continente","expt":"A large continent."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**I need to go to the airport.** — Preciso ir ao aeroporto.","**When do you want to go?** — Quando quer ir?","**At six.** — Às seis.","**Could you point me to…?** — Pode me indicar…?","**It’s on the second floor.** — Fica no segundo andar.","**It’s right behind you.** — Está logo atrás de você."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"agree","pt":"concordar","forms":[["I / you / we / they agree","I agree with you."],["he / she / it agrees","He agrees with me."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**pick up**","buscar","We pick you up at six. — Buscamos você às seis."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Calling a ride","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Calling a ride","lines":[["Ana","I need to go to the airport.","Preciso ir ao aeroporto."],["Driver","When do you want to go?","Quando quer ir?"],["Ana","At six.","Às seis."],["Driver","We pick you up at your door.","Buscamos na sua porta."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: I am × I’m","items":[{"label":"I am × I’m","note":"Na fala natural, I am vira I’m /aɪm/; you are vira you’re.","words":["I’m","you’re","she’s","we’re"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you want to do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I want to travel."},{"q":"Say what you need to do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I need to study."},{"q":"Ask: Do you want to…?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Do you want to go?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with want to and need to.","model":"I want to travel. I need to save money. She wants to go to the airport. They need to book early. Do you want to come?","checklist":["Usei **want to**","Usei **need to**","Usei **negativa**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “airport” mean?","opts":["aeroporto","passageiro","economizar"],"ans":0,"why":"**airport** = aeroporto."},{"q":"What does “passenger” mean?","opts":["reservar","passageiro","porta"],"ans":1,"why":"**passenger** = passageiro."},{"q":"What does “book” mean?","opts":["economizar","site","reservar"],"ans":2,"why":"**book** = reservar."},{"q":"What does “save” mean?","opts":["economizar","porta","carona/viagem"],"ans":0,"why":"**save** = economizar."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}